/0000-0002-6686-3728",{"_":257,"xml:id":258,"ref":259},"Simona Stoyanova","SS","https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3914-9569",{"_":261,"xml:id":262,"ref":263},"Zoe Greblunas","ZG","https://orcid.org/0009-0008-0871-248X",{"_":265,"xml:id":266,"ref":267},"Alessia Coccato","Coccato","https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6641-2820",{"_":269,"xml:id":270,"ref":271},"Marta Fogagnolo","martaf","https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5187-5163",{"_":273,"when":274,"who":275},"Marta Fogagnolo revised the text encoding, added the translation and the commentary","2026-08-03","#martaf",{"n":104,"url":105,"height":106,"width":107,"desc":108,"surfaceType":109},[278],{"atLeast":279,"atMost":280},15,25,[282,283,284,285,286,287,288,289],"Bulletin épigraphique, 1888-","Manni Piraino, 1973, IGMusPalermo","Frey, 1936-1952, CIJ","Frey, 1931, Inscriptions juives inédites","Frey, 1936-1952, Corpus Inscriptionum Iudaicarum: recueil des inscriptions juives qui vont du IIIe siècle avant Jésus-Christ au VIIe siècle de notre ère","Ferrua, 1958, In margine al Congresso Internazionale di Epigrafia","Lifshitz, 1963, Notes d'épigraphie grecque","Noy, 1993, Jewish inscriptions of Western Europe",[291,292,293,294,293,295,296,297],"77P5MNIR","F66S4X3M","ACIZXQF2","R4EUTP6G","TUW3AZ49","G88TZD3U","IBA4JMAN",[299,300,301,24,29,302,303,304,305,306,307,308,309,130],"isic001547","epitaph for zosimianos",{"_":5},"fine-grained, veined, white marble, likely lunense, docimian, hymettan, pentelic. digital microscopy: homeoblastic fabric (identification based on pxrf, digital microscopy)","catina","catania","sicilia","sicily","palermo","museo archeologico regionale antonino salinas","ancient greek",{"title":311,"body":312,"divs":313,"editions":332,"images":342,"handnote":348,"deprecation":22},"ISic001547. Epitaph for Zosimianos","\u003Cdiv id=\"editions\">\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  \u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ζωσιμιανοῦ\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ζωσιμιανοῦ\">Ζωσιμιανοῦ\u003C/span>\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"al2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἀγορασεία\">ἀγορασεία\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"al3-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἐνβάσεως\">ἐνβάσεως\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"al4-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>🕎 \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Ca id=\"al1-diplomatic\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ζωσιμιανοῦ\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ζωσιμιανοῦ\">ΖΩΣΙΜΙΑΝΟΥ\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cbr id=\"al2-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἀγορασεία\">ΑΓΟΡΑΣΕΙΑ\u003C/span>\u003Cbr id=\"al3-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἐνβάσεως\">ΕΝΒΑΣΕΩΣ\u003C/span>\u003Cbr id=\"al4-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>🕎\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"facsimile-images\">\u003Ch2>Facsimile Images\u003C/h2>\u003Ca href=\"ISic001547_tiled.tif\">\u003Cimg title=\"Photo J. Prag, courtesy  Museo Archeologico Regionale Antonino Salinas\" src=\"ISic001547_tiled-thumb.tif\">\u003C/a>\u003Ca href=\"ISic001547.jpg\">\u003Cimg title=\"Photo J. Prag, courtesy  Museo Archeologico Regionale Antonino Salinas\" src=\"ISic001547-thumb.jpg\">\u003C/a>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"apparatus\">\u003Ch4>Apparatus criticus\u003C/h4>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan>\u003Cspan>Text checked against photograph, and as per IGPalermo\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"translation\">\u003Ch2>English translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">\u003Ca href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5187-5163\">Marta Fogagnolo\u003C/a>\u003C/p>  \u003Cp>Purchase of a loculus by Zosimianos.\u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"commentary\">\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>  \u003Cp>The inscription records the purchase of a tomb by the deceased Zosimianos (the name is not attested elsewhere in Sicily, for the form \u003Cspan class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Ζώσιμος\u003C/span>, see LGPN IIIA 191). The purchase is expressed by the noun \u003Cspan class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">ἀγορασεία\u003C/span>, a term attested at Catania (see IG XIV 530b, 552; SEG IV 60; Libertini 1931, 369 no. 1). The burial place was most likely a loculus, as suggested by the small dimensions of the slab, and is designated by the term \u003Cspan class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">ἔμβασις\u003C/span> (for this term at Catania, see IGCVO 866; SEG XLVI 1261; IMusCatania 176; cf. Ferrua 1958, 172). Formulae expressing the purchase of a tomb by means of \u003Cspan class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">ἀγορασία\u003C/span> followed by the genitive of the purchaser's — or, in funerary contexts, the deceased's — name are particularly common at Syracuse, but are also attested at Catania (SEG IV 60). In the present inscription, the genitive of the object purchased also appears, as is perhaps likewise the case in Libertini 1931, 369 no. 1 (see Korhonen 2004, 109 n. 152). The menorah engraved at the end of the inscription identifies it as belonging to the corpus of Jewish inscriptions. For the Jewish presence in Sicily, and particularly at Catania, during Late Antiquity, see Gebbia 1996.\u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"bibliography\">\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> 1.654 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000582\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000582\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Frey 1931 122-125 ph \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001980\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001980\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Frey 1936 n. 654 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000582\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000582\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Ferrua 1958 172 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001998\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001998\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Lifshitz 1963 258-259 no.3 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001861\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001861\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> 1964 631 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001282\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001282\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Manni Piraino 1973 10 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000531\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000531\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Noy 1993 no.150 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000166\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000166\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> Gebbia 1996 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000582\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000582\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Korhonen 2004 109 n. 152 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000028\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000028\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"handnote\">\u003Cp>Lunate Σ and Ε, cursive Μ and Ω.\u003C/p> Line 1  15-25  Interlineation line 1 to 2    \u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence.  \u003C/div>",[314,317,320,323,326,329],{"id":315,"html":316},"editions","\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  \u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ζωσιμιανοῦ\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ζωσιμιανοῦ\">Ζωσιμιανοῦ\u003C/span>\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"al2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἀγορασεία\">ἀγορασεία\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"al3-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἐνβάσεως\">ἐνβάσεως\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"al4-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>🕎 \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Ca id=\"al1-diplomatic\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ζωσιμιανοῦ\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ζωσιμιανοῦ\">ΖΩΣΙΜΙΑΝΟΥ\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cbr id=\"al2-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἀγορασεία\">ΑΓΟΡΑΣΕΙΑ\u003C/span>\u003Cbr id=\"al3-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἐνβάσεως\">ΕΝΒΑΣΕΩΣ\u003C/span>\u003Cbr id=\"al4-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>🕎\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>",{"id":318,"html":319},"apparatus","\u003Ch4>Apparatus criticus\u003C/h4>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan>\u003Cspan>Text checked against photograph, and as per IGPalermo\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>",{"id":321,"html":322},"translation","\u003Ch2>English translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">\u003Ca href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5187-5163\">Marta Fogagnolo\u003C/a>\u003C/p>  \u003Cp>Purchase of a loculus by Zosimianos.\u003C/p>  ",{"id":324,"html":325},"commentary","\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>  \u003Cp>The inscription records the purchase of a tomb by the deceased Zosimianos (the name is not attested elsewhere in Sicily, for the form \u003Cspan class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Ζώσιμος\u003C/span>, see LGPN IIIA 191). The purchase is expressed by the noun \u003Cspan class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">ἀγορασεία\u003C/span>, a term attested at Catania (see IG XIV 530b, 552; SEG IV 60; Libertini 1931, 369 no. 1). The burial place was most likely a loculus, as suggested by the small dimensions of the slab, and is designated by the term \u003Cspan class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">ἔμβασις\u003C/span> (for this term at Catania, see IGCVO 866; SEG XLVI 1261; IMusCatania 176; cf. Ferrua 1958, 172). Formulae expressing the purchase of a tomb by means of \u003Cspan class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">ἀγορασία\u003C/span> followed by the genitive of the purchaser's — or, in funerary contexts, the deceased's — name are particularly common at Syracuse, but are also attested at Catania (SEG IV 60). In the present inscription, the genitive of the object purchased also appears, as is perhaps likewise the case in Libertini 1931, 369 no. 1 (see Korhonen 2004, 109 n. 152). The menorah engraved at the end of the inscription identifies it as belonging to the corpus of Jewish inscriptions. For the Jewish presence in Sicily, and particularly at Catania, during Late Antiquity, see Gebbia 1996.\u003C/p>  ",{"id":327,"html":328},"bibliography","\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> 1.654 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000582\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000582\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Frey 1931 122-125 ph \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001980\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001980\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Frey 1936 n. 654 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000582\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000582\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Ferrua 1958 172 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001998\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001998\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Lifshitz 1963 258-259 no.3 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001861\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001861\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> 1964 631 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001282\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001282\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Manni Piraino 1973 10 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000531\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000531\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Noy 1993 no.150 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000166\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000166\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> Gebbia 1996 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000582\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000582\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Korhonen 2004 109 n. 152 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000028\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000028\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  ",{"id":330,"html":331},"license"," Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence.  ",[333,335,338,339],{"html":334},"Text encoding: Jonathan Prag",{"id":336,"lang":130,"html":337},"edition-interpretive","\u003Cdiv class=\"te